{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XRavP71K4gDrRMZtopLiRK","type":"tool_result","content":"leEvil4-ResidentEvil4-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-162045\nmy node processes: 0\n24:  ['damageTaken', 'DAMAGE TAKEN X', 1, 0.1, 3, 0.05],\ntin in area.js: 0\n    cp.retries = (cp.retries ?? 0) + 1;\n    const cover = Math.min(1, 0.6 + cp.retries * 0.2);\n    app.run.health = Math.max(app.run.health, app.run.maxHealth * cover);\n    app.run.dameHealth = Math.max(app.run.dameHealth ?? 0, TUNING.dameHp * cover);\n    app.run.deathsThisChapter = deaths;\n    app.run.totals = totals;\n    app.run.rank = rank;\n    // A checkpoint saved short of ammunition shouldn't stay short: from the second retry the claims desk send\n    if (cp.retries >= 2) {\n      const parcel = Math.min(36, (cp.retries - 1) * 12);\n      app.run.case.addStack('ammoPistol', parcel);\n      app.run.giveItem('samphire');\n      app.run.parcelNote = true;\n361:    { id: 'westGate', trigger: { on: 'when', fn: (a) => a.run.flag('foghornDone') && a.level.info.col(a.pl\n24:    this.aimError = o.aimError ?? 0.022;\n35:    this.aimError = (this.o.aimError ?? 0.022) * Math.max(0.5, 1 - this.deaths * 0.05);\n98:    if (!threats.length) this.mixHerbs(P, dt);\n113:  mixHerbs(P, dt) {\n35:- **\"Some but not plenty\" (§15)** has no numbers. Measured as: at least 12 rounds left, fewer than were fired that chapter; earned at least the first gun's 900, less than that chapter's shop asks. `BalanceBook` in `tests/helpers.mjs`, en\n36:- **The bot's seeds (§15)** aren't specified. The plan describes one run; the test command runs four (7, 23, 19, 3).\n37:- **Help after deaths** is not in the plan, beyond rank. Continue adds a little with each retry of the same checkpoint: cover of 80%, then 100%; from the second retry a parcel of rounds and a samphire. Any gun left empty with nothing to \n38:- **Damage on Standard (§4, §12).** The DAMAGE TAKEN slider ships at its plain 1. Trimming it didn't help once the bugs were fixed: on 240 seeds, 1 had 2 go over the limit, 0.9 had 3, 0.85 had 3.\n## What can't be checked on this computer\n\nNobody has played it. A bot says what kills a bot. The real pad, phone, TV and second player are simulated, as TASK.md provides.\n36:export const PROMPT_FEEDBACK = [\n37-  'The plan was specific and had a voice: a whole world, a script, real numbers and a t\n38-  'TASK.md still asks me to pick the genre and perspective, while PLAN.md had already d\n39-  'Balance without a human. Every system worked long before the game was fair, and a bo\n40-  'Name what to cut first if a run gets long, and give balance targets for a kind of pl\n41-];\n343","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ab5fa620-49d1-4a79-852d-c0382e24fc6f","uuid":"cc4e304b-8c66-447b-88fa-c17352d478ff","timestamp":"2026-11-06T22:20:47.268Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"leEvil4-ResidentEvil4-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-162045\nmy node processes: 0\n24:  ['damageTaken', 'DAMAGE TAKEN X', 1, 0.1, 3, 0.05],\ntin in area.js: 0\n    cp.retries = (cp.retries ?? 0) + 1;\n    const cover = Math.min(1, 0.6 + cp.retries * 0.2);\n    app.run.health = Math.max(app.run.health, app.run.maxHealth * cover);\n    app.run.dameHealth = Math.max(app.run.dameHealth ?? 0, TUNING.dameHp * cover);\n    app.run.deathsThisChapter = deaths;\n    app.run.totals = totals;\n    app.run.rank = rank;\n    // A checkpoint saved short of ammunition shouldn't stay short: from the second retry the claims desk send\n    if (cp.retries >= 2) {\n      const parcel = Math.min(36, (cp.retries - 1) * 12);\n      app.run.case.addStack('ammoPistol', parcel);\n      app.run.giveItem('samphire');\n      app.run.parcelNote = true;\n361:    { id: 'westGate', trigger: { on: 'when', fn: (a) => a.run.flag('foghornDone') && a.level.info.col(a.pl\n24:    this.aimError = o.aimError ?? 0.022;\n35:    this.aimError = (this.o.aimError ?? 0.022) * Math.max(0.5, 1 - this.deaths * 0.05);\n98:    if (!th